ing to be successful for the studio  seemingly suggesting it has no plans to  remove it we understand that there's a  lot of fury anger and disappointment  with us adding them from an economic  standpoint however completely based on  statistics we can already see that the  black market update is working as  intended going forward we  we can convince the parts of the  community that resists this change that  this was the right decision to do to  ensure the stability of overkill as an  independent developer and the future  growth of payday 2 finally if you were  sad to hear that that game with Darth  Maul was cancelled there's a new hope  developer red fly is working on a  next-gen demo to show to EA the  developers behind the cancelled star  wars game that would have starred the  nefarious 5th Lord Darth Maul is now  saying they're planning to resurrect the  title in a recent reddit AMA red fly  studio CEO and owner Danforth talked  more about the project and how he hopes  it can eventually see the light of day  in an online Q&amp;A session forth revealed  that red fly is currently working on a  full next-gen demo of all things mall to  show to the powers that be he added it's  been a lot of work on our off time  according to a 2014 report the Darth  Maul game was in development for 360 ps3  and Wii U the new edition is presumably  for next-generation consoles well that's  all the news for today but be sure to  check back tomorrow when we'll have more  news and a metric butt ton of halo 5  coverage
 

